---
title: 'Lemon Tart'
description: 'A shortcrust base, split into its own file and pulled in with @use.'
category: 'Dessert'
portions: 8
---

@use "./bases/pate-sablee.gram" as &pate

## Curd ->&curd

[Whisk] @egg{3}, @sugar{150 g}, and @lemon juice{120 ml} in a #saucepan over low heat until thickened, about ~{8min}.

[Remove] from heat and whisk in the @butter{80 g} until glossy.

## Montage

[Line] a #tart tin(24cm) with &pate{250 g}, rolled out thin.

[Blind bake] at ^{180C} for ~_{15min}.

[Fill] the baked shell with the &curd and chill for ~_{2h} before serving.
